      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba ng'asheesu ning'waar fuga saang'a nea goorootooschi, aba iita ng'asheega ghayi sisin aba dageascheedeanya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gawuurji gidaghayi goondaneasa muushoodiga dea ea aba heeda fuga rukwiida ng'asheanda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea naadaayi eara aniini gideaba ghwahit, ak ea neasikteawi muuchi gidaghayi ng'eata ng'asheesu seaniin aba beanata, ak geang'oorneey ng'asheesu nea ghaadoabiiwji Diofiloheeda mureeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda gay nala huumeanda aba badayda ng'asheega ghayi sibean sirukuneeyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Geerugu jeata Yohaneeda Abaatiisachi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damanda waseewa Herode sugoocheanda Yudeya, abeeda gwanda ashoohoocheanji siguura Sakariya, bea gharmucheanda Abiya, nea gwandeawa gatmoadaanyi bea haweega Haruni, nea gheawungaaschi geeguura Elisabeti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea abeeda saawa ea doobiiweadi aba madeeda ASEETA, nea ghoang'waay muuchi diigheanyeeka sean ea huumeanyeeka Ng'utamiida nea meerukunana badahuuka ng'asheega munyas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda ea mandeawana baleanda aba gideaba Elisabeti soonooda nea niwoosiidi sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba damanda sineewa gadiyeeda ashoohoocheanduumeeda aba madeeda ASEETA nea abeeda ea galanyeanda sineewa gadiyeeda lugoadaanyi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba seareedida bea gissiniida ashoohoodiga gadiyeedean, inyeesa ghwaloat ASEETA siida gawa jeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA bea Ng'utamiida ghaghwarda geeta siing'andiita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba damani siing'andiida gheedean abeeda gwanda Eemeesean daghata gheeda ghamwaash ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goobeersa Malaykajeanda",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Malaykajeanda: Giijasoocheanda ASEETA leabu humng'eeda.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ng'utamiida ak ghamiinaada aba murdeeda geatinda dugwa bea heeda wagiida siyiina geeta siing'andiita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daah Sakariya gwahirbaban nea ghabeal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha Malaykajeanda, “Adibeali, Sakariya, aba gideaba siyiiy gidimwaashi, nea eara Elisabeteeda was gatmoadaang'u gaygwajiilneey baleanda, ak gaygureewana gheawungaaschi Yohana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Geerugu jeata Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sheedeaba lah goojeakta ASEETA malaykajeanda siguura Gabrieli gawa mujiineeda Nasareti mida ng'eanyiida Galilaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hichpa hudi miyeasat siguura Mariya, anyeari siisi siguura Yosefu bea dooshagi sea sugoocheanda siguura Dawdi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwahidu headaanyi ak gwayeesha, “Seayu ang'iing'eeda siitaw dagheerjeanduumeeda ang'iing'i gindeayi sea Ng'utamiida!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwadeawiit muuchi aba ng'asheanji ak gooteemsheesa seayoani giduurji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Malaykajeanda, “Adibeali Mariya, aba gideaba nigoonyi ASEETA dagheerjeanduumeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ng'ula, gaygweayiida ak Gayjiila baleanda, ak gayguureewana gheawungaaschi Yesu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mariya gabareasa Elisabeti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Askwearjoojigiga ghang'eat Mariya ak ghwalamwajaada gawa ng'eanyiida heayeeniiga jeeda mujiineeda Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gawa jeeda gheeh Sakariya ak googeachi Elisabeti; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iiy Elisabeti giigeacheeda Mariya, ghwadanghan baleanda mida jeadaanyi ak geanyiit Elisabeti Guroorooda Ghaydit ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "goojuur aba ghuuta haw nea gwayi, “Sigoonyi ghawooda aba jeeda gadeemga, ak ea siitaw ghawooda dea jea jiila! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gayghoawdaani aba heedeanyu, gideaba ghwahidu heedeanyu gheamata Ng'utamiideanyu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba ng'ula, iyaayiinyi ghuuta seayoadaang'u ghwadanghan baleanda mida jeedeanyu aba ng'weelooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'wana siida jea ghamwas gideaba gay gwasa ng'asheega rukusa Ng'utamiida.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sarmeeda Mariya bea duumsheesiinda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
